    },
    {
      "name": "Agent Tabs",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "tab",
      "description": "One agent at a time; monogram plus function name, cobalt underline on selection.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tabs\"><button class=\"ds-tab\" aria-selected=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-mark\">S</span>Site</button><button class=\"ds-tab\" aria-selected=\"false\"><span class=\"ds-mark\">Z</span>Zoning</button><button class=\"ds-tab\" aria-selected=\"false\"><span class=\"ds-mark\">C</span>Cost</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tabs{display:flex;gap:2px;padding:0 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.ds-tab{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:40px;padding:0 8px;border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--text-2);font:500 13px var(--font);cursor:pointer;transition:color 120ms var(--ease)}.ds-tab:hover,.ds-tab[aria-selected=true]{color:var(--text)}.ds-tab[aria-selected=true]::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:6px;right:6px;bottom:-1px;height:2px;border-radius:1px;background:var(--accent)}.ds-mark{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:var(--r-sm);border:1px solid var(--border-strong);background:var(--surface-2);color:var(--text);font:600 10px/1 var(--mono)}.ds-tab[aria-selected=true] .ds-mark{background:var(--text);border-color:var(--text);color:var(--surface)}.ds-tab:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Agent Map Tag",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "agent-tag",
      "description": "Floating label tracking an agent pin; inverts when active.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-atag\"><span class=\"ds-amark\">P</span>Policy</span> <span class=\"ds-atag on\"><span class=\"ds-amark\">S</span>Site</span>",
      "css": ".ds-atag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:22px;padding:0 7px 0 3px;border:1px solid var(--border-strong);border-radius:var(--r);background:var(--surface);color:var(--text-2);font:500 12px var(--font);box-shadow:var(--elev-1)}.ds-amark{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:var(--r-sm);border:1px solid var(--border-strong);background:var(--surface-2);color:var(--text);font:600 10px/1 var(--mono)}.ds-atag.on{border-color:var(--text);background:var(--text);color:var(--surface)}.ds-atag.on .ds-amark{background:var(--surface);border-color:var(--surface);color:var(--text)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tool-call Trace",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "trace",
      "description": "Signature: every tool call under an answer, expandable to full arguments.",
      "html": "<ul class=\"ds-trace\"><li><details><summary><span class=\"fn\">home_report</span><span class=\"args\">{\"lot\":1182}</span></summary><pre>{\n  \"lot\": 1182\n}</pre></details></li><li><details><summary><span class=\"fn\">cost_estimate</span><span class=\"args\">{\"sqft\":600,\"kind\":\"cottage\"}</span><span class=\"pre\">pre-run</span></summary><pre>{\n  \"sqft\": 600,\n  \"kind\": \"cottage\"\n}</pre></details></li></ul>",
      "css": ".ds-trace{margin:0;padding:6px 8px;list-style:none;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);background:var(--surface-2);font:400 11px/1.6 var(--mono);color:var(--text-2)}.ds-trace summary{display:flex;gap:6px;min-width:0;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;border-radius:var(--r-sm)}.ds-trace summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.ds-trace summary::before{content:\"\";flex:none;width:0;height:0;margin-top:6px;border:3.5px solid transparent;border-left-color:var(--text-3);transition:transform 120ms var(--ease);transform-origin:25% 50%}.ds-trace details[open]>summary::before{transform:rotate(90deg)}.ds-trace summary:hover .fn{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px}.ds-trace summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}.ds-trace .fn{color:var(--text);flex:none}.ds-trace .args{min-width:0;color:var(--text-3);overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}.ds-trace details[open] .args{display:none}.ds-trace .pre{flex:none;margin-left:auto;color:var(--text-3)}.ds-trace pre{margin:4px 0 6px 12px;padding:6px 8px;border-left:1px solid var(--border-strong);color:var(--text-2);font:inherit;white-space:pre-wrap}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Planning Workstation",
    "overview": "PlotTwist is a docked, three-pane instrument over a real 3D city: a fact sidebar on the left, the map in the centre, an agent console on the right, all under a 48px bar. Surfaces are opaque, borders are 1px hairlines, elevation is nearly flat, and density is that of a production tool (13px body, 28px controls). The world is cool zinc neutrals with exactly one chromatic voice, cobalt, plus four muted verdict colours that appear only where they encode a verdict.\n\nThe system's claim is that code decides and the model only talks, so its signature is evidentiary: every agent answer carries a monospace tool-call trace that expands to the full arguments. Numbers are tabular, machine names are mono, and the map is a view rather than a decorative backdrop. The product record pins the register (Linear, Vercel, Stripe Dashboard, GitHub): no emojis, no glassmorphism, no promotional copy.\n\nLight and dark themes are equal citizens; the theme is set before paint from `localStorage['plottwist-theme']` so a dark reload never flashes light.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Three docked panes (320px / fluid / 384px) under a 48px bar; no floating cards over the map except the legend and map tools.",
      "Cool neutral ground, one accent (cobalt), verdict colours as state only.",
      "Geist for UI, Geist Mono for measurements, counts, tool names and traces.",
      "4 / 6 / 8px radii, 1px hairlines, two whisper-weight shadows.",
      "Agents are square monograms with a one-word function name.",
      "The expandable tool-call trace is the signature component."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The One Cobalt Rule",
        "body": "Cobalt is the only chromatic accent: action, selection, focus and proposed geometry. Nothing else gets a hue.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Verdict-Only Rule",
        "body": "Green, ochre, brick and review gray appear only where they encode a verdict or a live/idle state. They never decorate.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Machine-Speaks-Mono Rule",
        "body": "Tool names, arguments, rule values, deltas and agent monograms are set in Geist Mono; human prose is Geist.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Tabular Rule",
        "body": "Every count, share, area and delta uses tabular numerals.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Hairline-First Rule",
        "body": "Separate with a 1px border before reaching for a shadow; surfaces are opaque.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** keep cobalt to action, selection, focus and proposed geometry (The One Cobalt Rule).",
      "**Do** pair every verdict colour with its text label; dots and meters are never the only carrier.",
      "**Do** set machine output (tool names, arguments, rule values, deltas) in Geist Mono with tabular numerals.",
      "**Do** show the tool-call trace under every agent answer that called tools.",
      "**Do** identify agents only by square monogram plus one-word function name.",
      "**Do** separate with 1px hairlines and keep surfaces opaque; use rest lift only for elements floating over the map or another surface.",
      "**Do** define every new colour for both themes."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** use emojis, glassmorphism or promotional copy (product brand commitment).",
      "**Don't** introduce a second accent hue or use verdict colours decoratively.",
      "**Don't** give agents human names, faces or mascots.",
      "**Don't** float cards over the map beyond the legend and map tools; panels dock.",
      "**Don't** add uppercase eyebrows or kicker labels above headings; sections are titled by plain 13px/600 headings.",
      "**Don't** exceed the 16px top of the type ramp inside the workstation."
    ]
  }
}
